add('Public types lack Debug implementations','token.rs:67',ids((104,106),(108,109),(261,265)),'not-defect',None,'TokenReuseError and representative public types lack Debug; Result::expect requires Debug for its error. Adding diagnostic traits is public-API style housekeeping; reported totals vary with the feature set.','skill-requested-hygiene')
add('Unchecked VarInt conversions lack invariant explanations','connection/send_buffer.rs:99',ids((110,114),(266,270)),'not-defect',None,'The four cited calls lack adjacent explanations of the required 62-bit bound. Comments would improve maintenance; the concrete StreamId bounds failure is assessed separately.','skill-requested-hygiene')
